  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The half life for the decomposition of gaseous compound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>240</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> when the gaseous pressure was <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn></math> Torr initially. When the pressure was <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn></math> Torr, the half life was found to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math>. The order of the reaction is _____ (Nearest integer)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>torr</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>240</mn><mi>sec</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>torr</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msub></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>250</mn><mn>500</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub></math> is independent of initial pressure. Hence, order is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>st order.</p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
